<section class="l-section l-section-alt" id="como-funciona">
  <div class="l-container">
    <div class="l-section-head">
      <h1 style="font-size: 30px;"><span class="l-accent-hot">4 passos pra virar dev raiz!</span></h1>
      <p>Instale, escreva em português e publique. Sem fricção, sem dependências, sem complicação.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="l-steps">
      <div class="l-step reveal">
        <div class="l-step-top">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined l-step-icon">download</span>
          <span class="l-step-num">1</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Instale</h3>
        <p>Um binário só com CLI, compilador e ORM embutido. Roda em Windows, macOS e Linux.</p>
        <div class="l-step-code">
          <div class="l-code-bar"><span class="l-code-file">terminal</span></div>
          <pre><code>npm install -g xanascript</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="l-step reveal" style="transition-delay:0.08s;">
        <div class="l-step-top">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined l-step-icon">edit_note</span>
          <span class="l-step-num">2</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Escreva</h3>
        <p>cria, resolve, DB, repete-na-moral — keywords e erros de compilação no seu idioma.</p>
        <div class="l-step-code">
          <div class="l-code-bar"><span class="l-code-file">ola.xs</span></div>
          <pre><code>grita-ae("Ola, mundo!")</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="l-step reveal" style="transition-delay:0.16s;">
        <div class="l-step-top">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined l-step-icon">bolt</span>
          <span class="l-step-num">3</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Compile</h3>
        <p>Saída otimizada para JavaScript ou WebAssembly, com constant folding e loop unrolling.</p>
        <div class="l-step-code">
          <div class="l-code-bar"><span class="l-code-file">terminal</span></div>
          <pre><code>xs compile --target wasm</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="l-step reveal" style="transition-delay:0.24s;">
        <div class="l-step-top">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined l-step-icon">rocket_launch</span>
          <span class="l-step-num">4</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Publique</h3>
        <p>Publique pacotes direto do terminal e compartilhe com a comunidade. Versionamento incluso.</p>
        <div class="l-step-code">
          <div class="l-code-bar"><span class="l-code-file">terminal</span></div>
          <pre><code>xs publish</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="l-steps-stats reveal">
      <div class="l-step-stat">
        <strong>0</strong>
        <span>dependências externas</span>
      </div>
      <div class="l-step-stat">
        <strong>2</strong>
        <span>alvos de compilação</span>
      </div>
      <div class="l-step-stat">
        <strong>4</strong>
        <span>sistemas, incluindo Android</span>
      </div>
      <div class="l-step-stat">
        <strong>∞</strong>
        <span>código no seu idioma</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="l-section" id="recursos">
