</section>

<section class="l-section l-section-alt">
  <div class="l-container">
    <div class="l-section-head">
      <h1 style="font-size: 30px;"><span class="l-accent-hot">escreve, roda, resolve.</span></h1>
      <p>Um programa XanaScript de verdade: função, loop e ORM embutido, tudo no seu idioma.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="l-example reveal-scale">
      <div class="l-code">
        <div class="l-code-bar">
          <span class="l-code-dot" style="background:#dc2626"></span>
          <span class="l-code-dot" style="background:#d97706"></span>
          <span class="l-code-dot" style="background:#16a34a"></span>
          <span class="l-code-file">exemplo.xs</span>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="kw">cria</span> fib = (n) => <span class="kw">vai-de</span> (n) {
  <span class="kw">se-for</span> 0 => 0
  <span class="kw">se-for</span> 1 => 1
  <span class="kw">se-nao-der</span> => fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2)
}

<span class="kw">cria</span> nomes = [<span class="str">"Ana"</span>, <span class="str">"Bia"</span>, <span class="str">"Caio"</span>]
<span class="kw">repete-na-moral</span> (<span class="kw">cria</span> i = 0; i &lt; 3; i++) {
  <span class="kw">grita-ae</span>(<span class="str">"Olá, "</span> + nomes[i])
}

<span class="str">// ORM</span>
<span class="kw">DB</span> Produto {
  nome: <span class="type">eh-palavra</span>
  preco: <span class="type">eh-numero</span>
}
<span class="kw">cria</span> repo = <span class="kw">DB</span> Produto
repo.bota-ai({nome: <span class="str">"Teclado"</span>, preco: 250})</code></pre>
